				<r3d:description language="eng">The Mediterranean Sea ecosystem provides fundamental resources and services that support large and complex human socio-economic activities, that can be severely impacted by both natural and anthropogenic stressors. Management, restoration and preservation of the Mediterranean Sea Health require an advanced understanding of the marine ecosystem functioning, fostering innovative approaches to provide science-based solutions for sustainable development, such as those enabled through future Digital Twins of the Ocean.</r3d:description>
